# kachakachaCAD project script
#
# Units are millimeters.
# Axis convention:
# X = length direction, Y = width/depth direction, Z = height direction.
#
# Commands used here:
# plane_three NAME ax ay az bx by bz cx cy cz
# plane_point_normal NAME ox oy oz nx ny nz ux uy uz
# plane_offset NAME SOURCE distance
# plane_rotate NAME SOURCE ax ay az dx dy dz angleDegrees
# line3d NAME sx sy sz ex ey ez
# circle3d NAME cx cy cz ux uy uz vx vy vz radius
# arc3d NAME cx cy cz ux uy uz vx vy vz radius startDegrees sweepDegrees
# sketch_line NAME PLANE su sv eu ev [free|reference|locked]
# sketch_circle NAME PLANE cu cv radius [free|reference|locked]
# sketch_arc NAME PLANE cu cv radius startDegrees sweepDegrees [free|reference|locked]
# sketch_bezier NAME PLANE su sv c1u c1v c2u c2v eu ev [free|reference|locked]

plane_three floor 0 0 0  1 0 0  0 1 0
plane_point_normal front 10 0 0  1 0 0  0 1 0
plane_offset front_outer front 1.2
plane_rotate cab_slope front 10 0 0  0 1 0  -18
plane_three free_paper 0 0 1  8 1 2.2  1 6 5

# The question from earlier: origin to X=2 Y=7 Z=4.
line3d origin_to_point 0 0 0  2 7 4

# Lines and curves drawn on the X=10 front work plane.
sketch_line front_window_bottom front 1.5 2.0  7.0 2.0
sketch_line front_window_top front 1.5 5.0  7.0 5.0 locked
sketch_circle front_light_left front 2.5 3.5 0.65 reference
sketch_circle front_light_right front 6.0 3.5 0.65 reference
sketch_arc front_roof_corner front 7.0 6.0 1.2 180 90 locked
sketch_bezier front_nose_curve front 0.0 0.0  1.0 4.0  6.0 4.0  7.0 0.0

# A line and curve drawn on an arbitrary plane created from three selected points.
sketch_line free_plane_line free_paper -4 -2  5 3
sketch_bezier free_plane_curve free_paper -4 3  -1 6  3 -2  5 1
